<title>USA: FDA clears Royce Labs drug application.</title>
<headline>FDA clears Royce Labs drug application.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royce Laboratories Inc said it has received approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for its Carisoprodol Tables USP in 350 mg strength.</p>
<p>Carisoprodol is the generic equivalent of Wallace Laboratories' Soma, which is a muscle relaxant drug.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
